---
// Side-by-side cross-section showing how a single overhead light source
// creates raised depth (lit top edge + bottom shadow) vs inset depth (top inner shadow + lit bottom lip).
const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
---
<figure class="dls">
  <div class="dls-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Cross-section comparing a raised surface and an inset surface under one overhead light source. The raised surface has a bright top edge and a shadow beneath its bottom edge; the inset well has a dark inner shadow at the top and a lit rim at the bottom.">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id={`dls-ray-${uid}`} x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="var(--gold)" stop-opacity="0.55" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="var(--gold)" stop-opacity="0.05" />
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>

      <!-- Overhead light source bar -->
      <line x1="200" y1="22" x2="700" y2="22" class="dls-light-bar" />
      <text x="450" y="15" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-light-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Overhead light source</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nguồn sáng chiếu từ trên xuống</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Light rays (left: raised, right: inset) -->
      {[155, 225, 295, 605, 675, 745].map((rx) => (
        <g>
          <line x1={rx} y1="28" x2={rx} y2="72" stroke={`url(#dls-ray-${uid})`} stroke-width="2" />
          <polygon points={`${rx - 4},68 ${rx + 4},68 ${rx},76`} class="dls-ray-tip" />
        </g>
      ))}

      <!-- LEFT PANEL: Raised element -->
      <rect x="40" y="84" width="380" height="196" rx="10" class="dls-panel" />
      <text x="60" y="110" class="dls-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Raised (button, card)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nổi lên (nút bấm, thẻ)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Raised mock button -->
      <rect x="115" y="156" width="230" height="58" rx="8" class="dls-drop-shadow" />
      <rect x="115" y="148" width="230" height="58" rx="8" class="dls-raised-box" />
      <!-- Top lit edge highlight -->
      <line x1="123" y1="150" x2="337" y2="150" class="dls-top-highlight" />
      <text x="230" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-btn-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Save changes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu thay đổi</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Annotations for raised -->
      <line x1="230" y1="130" x2="230" y2="146" class="dls-pointer" />
      <text x="230" y="126" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lighter top edge catches light</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mép trên sáng hơn đón ánh sáng</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="230" y1="216" x2="230" y2="234" class="dls-pointer is-red" />
      <text x="230" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-note is-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tight dark shadow cast below</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bóng tối gọn đổ xuống mép dưới</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- RIGHT PANEL: Inset element -->
      <rect x="480" y="84" width="380" height="196" rx="10" class="dls-panel" />
      <text x="500" y="110" class="dls-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Inset (input, recessed well)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lõm xuống (ô nhập liệu, khay)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Inset mock input -->
      <rect x="555" y="148" width="230" height="58" rx="8" class="dls-inset-box" />
      <!-- Inner top shadow bar -->
      <rect x="557" y="149" width="226" height="6" rx="3" class="dls-inner-shadow" />
      <!-- Bottom lit rim -->
      <line x1="563" y1="205" x2="777" y2="205" class="dls-bottom-highlight" />
      <text x="575" y="183" class="dls-input-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>search@example.com</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>timkiem@example.com</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Annotations for inset -->
      <line x1="670" y1="130" x2="670" y2="147" class="dls-pointer is-red" />
      <text x="670" y="126" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-note is-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Inner shadow under top lip</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bóng trong hắt dưới mép trên</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="670" y1="208" x2="670" y2="234" class="dls-pointer" />
      <text x="670" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="dls-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Lighter bottom lip catches light</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mép dưới sáng hơn hứng ánh sáng</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One overhead light source flips the cue: raised surfaces are bright on top and shadowed beneath; recessed wells reverse the pair.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một nguồn sáng từ trên xuống nhưng đảo ngược dấu hiệu: bề mặt nổi sáng ở mép trên và tối phía dưới; ô lõm làm ngược lại.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dls { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dls-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dls svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dls text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .dls-light-bar { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 3; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .dls text.dls-light-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dls-ray-tip { fill: var(--gold); opacity: 0.65; }
  .dls-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dls text.dls-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dls-drop-shadow { fill: var(--text); opacity: 0.14; }
  .dls-raised-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dls-top-highlight { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.85; }
  .dls text.dls-btn-label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .dls-inset-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dls-inner-shadow { fill: var(--text); opacity: 0.14; }
  .dls-bottom-highlight { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.5; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.85; }
  .dls text.dls-input-label { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dls-pointer { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dls-pointer.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .dls text.dls-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dls text.dls-note.is-red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .dls figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
